  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e03c536f4a8ad1f0",
      "translationZh": "目标基本上就是：别对我隐藏协议细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "285e2d92f7929e62",
      "translationZh": "它暴露了原始流式数据块、推理增量、工具调用片段、完成原因、取消操作、带类型的请求对象、上下文管理、强类型工具以及并发工具执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "650df4b120fe8f39",
      "translationZh": "但它仍然提供了一条简单的高层使用路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da262ab15c15c0e3",
      "translationZh": "我构建它主要是因为，我想在一个实验性的异步工具调用框架之下放置一个非常底层的 API 层，让生成过程能够在工具并行执行时继续进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd204f8464156975",
      "translationZh": "这个框架本身将与 API 库保持分离。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32c05fb891337129",
      "translationZh": "目前只实现了 /v1/chat/completions。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30199ad7a4247f55",
      "translationZh": "它仍处于非常活跃的开发阶段，API 可能会发生变化，但任何人都可以自由使用它、参与贡献、把它弄坏或提供反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a444cf578327cde",
      "translationZh": "用法示例：Github - Example.cs",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4eb89ef9ea99f18c",
      "translationZh": "尤其希望收到其他 .NET + llama.cpp 用户的反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6be9023853ac4412",
      "translationZh": "（这个项目之后会作为 NuGet 包发布，目前只是一个控制台应用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
